00:01:12.038 --> 00:01:19.813 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mais rieMais rieMais rieMais ris

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:21.014 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pompiers n'iront pas vous sauver

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:22.215 size:53% position:73% line:53%
